<title>USA: Mt Lebanon SD, Pa., won by Mellon Financial.</title>
<headline>Mt Lebanon SD, Pa., won by Mellon Financial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Financial Markets, Inc said it won $6.600 million of Mt. Lebanon School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series of 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.090 percent.</p>
</text>
